---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout>
	<div class="page">
		<header class="nav">
			<div class="logo">Painora</div>
			<nav class="nav-links">
				<a href="#how">How it works</a>
				<a href="#marketplace">The flow</a>
				<a href="#governance">Ownership</a>
				<a href="#funding">Funding</a>
			</nav>
		<div class="nav-cta">
			<a class="ghost" href="/pains">Browse pains</a>
			<a class="primary" href="/chat">Declare a pain</a>
		</div>
		</header>

		<main>
			<section class="hero">
				<div class=”hero-copy reveal delay-1”>
					<p class=”eyebrow”>Problems are more valuable than ideas.</p>
					<h1>
						Turn real human pain into<br />real products — together.
					</h1>
					<p class=”subhead”>
						Describe what hurts. AI refines the problem. Designers propose solutions.
						The community merges the best ideas into working products.
					</p>
				<div class=”hero-actions”>
					<a class=”primary” href=”/chat”>Declare a pain</a>
					<a class=”ghost” href=”#how”>See the flow</a>
				</div>
					<div class="trust">
						<span>Built for makers, problem-solvers, and bold users</span>
						<div class="pill">IP stays with creators</div>
					</div>
				</div>
				<div class="hero-card reveal delay-2">
					<div class="card-top">
						<div>
							<h3>Declared pain</h3>
							<p>I need a calendar for all my friends’ birthdays.</p>
						</div>
						<span class="badge">New</span>
					</div>
					<div class="card-body">
						<div class="metric">
							<span>AI clarity score</span>
							<strong>92% aligned after 4 questions</strong>
						</div>
						<div class="metric">
							<span>Solution pool</span>
							<strong>7 proposals from 3 architects</strong>
						</div>
					<div class="metric">
						<span>Merge celebration</span>
						<strong>Public event next Friday</strong>
					</div>
					</div>
					<div class="card-footer">
						<div>
							<span class="dot"></span>
							Funding pledged
						</div>
						<strong>$2,400</strong>
					</div>
				</div>
			</section>

			<section class="grid" id="how">
				<div class="tile reveal delay-1">
					<h2>Pain → Structure → Solution</h2>
					<p>
						Start with a plain-language pain. AI interviews you, removes ambiguity,
						and produces a formal Problem Specification. No idea pitches. Just the real problem.
					</p>
				</div>
				<div class="tile reveal delay-2">
					<h3>1. Declare</h3>
					<p>Describe what hurts — in plain language. No frameworks, no jargon.</p>
				</div>
				<div class="tile reveal delay-3">
					<h3>2. Clarify</h3>
					<p>AI asks until the pain is precise, structured, and ready to be solved.</p>
				</div>
				<div class="tile reveal delay-4">
					<h3>3. Merge & build</h3>
					<p>Designers propose. The best ideas merge into a blueprint. Builders ship.</p>
				</div>
			</section>

			<section class="split" id="marketplace">
				<div class="reveal delay-1">
					<h2>The solution marketplace</h2>
					<p>
						Problem solvers compete, collaborate, and merge. Original designers
						keep IP ownership and license it to developers who build the product.
					</p>
					<a class="merge-link" href="/merge">Watch a Merge Festival live →</a>
				</div>
				<div class="steps">
					<div class="step reveal delay-1">
						<span>1</span>
						<div>
							<strong>Architect proposals</strong>
							<p>Submit solution blueprints and business models.</p>
						</div>
					</div>
				<div class="step reveal delay-2">
					<span>2</span>
					<div>
						<strong>Public merge celebration</strong>
						<p>Community and judges merge the best ideas into one plan.</p>
					</div>
				</div>
					<div class="step reveal delay-3">
						<span>3</span>
						<div>
							<strong>License + build</strong>
							<p>Developers license the design and ship the product.</p>
						</div>
					</div>
				</div>
			</section>

			<section class="testimonials" id="governance">
				<div class="reveal delay-1">
					<h2>Governance that protects creators</h2>
					<p>
						Painora keeps the initial designer as the IP owner. Licensing makes
						building easy and fair.
					</p>
				</div>
				<div class="quote-grid">
					<article class="reveal delay-1">
						<p>
							“Painora makes IP clear from day one. Designers lead, builders
							license, everyone wins.”
						</p>
						<span>Product architect</span>
					</article>
					<article class="reveal delay-2">
						<p>
							“The merge celebration creates focus. We stop debating and ship the
							best combined plan.”
						</p>
						<span>Innovation lead</span>
					</article>
					<article class="reveal delay-3">
						<p>
							“It feels like a marketplace for hard problems — with a real path
							to ownership.”
						</p>
						<span>Independent builder</span>
					</article>
				</div>
			</section>

			<section class="pricing" id="funding">
				<div class="price-card reveal delay-1">
					<div>
						<h2>Funding model that de-risks work</h2>
						<p>
							Users authorize a starter amount. Full payment only happens after
							satisfaction with the delivered solution.
						</p>
					</div>
					<ul>
						<li>Upfront pledge to open the project</li>
						<li>Milestone transparency through delivery</li>
						<li>Final payment after approval</li>
					</ul>
					<a class="primary" href="/chat">Back a project</a>
				</div>
				<div class="price-details reveal delay-2">
					<h3>For solution builders</h3>
					<p>Get early access to the pain marketplace and licensing tools.</p>
					<a class="ghost" href="/chat">Join as a builder</a>
				</div>
			</section>

			<section class="cta" id="cta">
				<div class="reveal delay-1">
					<h2>Ready to declare a pain?</h2>
					<p>
						Start a conversation. AI will clarify the real problem, structure it,
						and open it to designers and builders.
					</p>
				</div>
				<div class="cta-actions reveal delay-2">
					<div class="chat-input" aria-label="Declare a pain">
						<span>painora.ai/chat</span>
						<input type="text" placeholder="Describe your pain..." />
						<a class="chat-button" href="/chat">Start chat</a>
					</div>
				</div>
			</section>
		</main>

		<footer class="footer">
			<span>© 2026 Painora. All rights reserved.</span>
			<div class="footer-links">
				<a href="mailto:hello@painora.com">hello@painora.com</a>
				<a href="#">Privacy</a>
				<a href="#">Terms</a>
			</div>
		</footer>
	</div>
</Layout>

<style>
	:global(body) {
		margin: 0;
		background: #0c0b11;
		color: #f5f2ea;
		font-family: 'Space Grotesk', system-ui, sans-serif;
	}

	:global(*) {
		box-sizing: border-box;
	}

	.page {
		min-height: 100vh;
		background:
			radial-gradient(circle at 12% 20%, rgba(218, 126, 69, 0.25), transparent 50%),
			radial-gradient(circle at 80% 0%, rgba(104, 199, 209, 0.22), transparent 50%),
			linear-gradient(140deg, rgba(12, 11, 17, 0.9), rgba(17, 15, 26, 0.9));
		padding: 32px clamp(20px, 6vw, 96px) 64px;
	}

	.nav {
		display: flex;
		align-items: center;
		justify-content: space-between;
		gap: 24px;
		position: sticky;
		top: 0;
		padding: 20px 0 28px;
		backdrop-filter: blur(10px);
		z-index: 10;
	}

	.logo {
		font-family: 'Fraunces', 'Times New Roman', serif;
		font-size: 28px;
		letter-spacing: 0.02em;
	}

	.nav-links {
		display: flex;
		gap: 20px;
	}

	.nav a {
		color: #f5f2ea;
		text-decoration: none;
		font-size: 15px;
		opacity: 0.8;
		transition: opacity 0.2s ease;
	}

	.nav a:hover {
		opacity: 1;
	}

	.nav-cta {
		display: flex;
		gap: 12px;
	}

	.primary,
	.ghost {
		border-radius: 999px;
		padding: 12px 20px;
		font-size: 14px;
		text-decoration: none;
		display: inline-flex;
		align-items: center;
		justify-content: center;
		gap: 8px;
		transition: transform 0.2s ease, box-shadow 0.2s ease, background 0.2s ease;
	}

	.primary {
		background: linear-gradient(120deg, #f3a35c, #f16068);
		color: #0c0b11;
		box-shadow: 0 12px 30px rgba(243, 163, 92, 0.35);
	}

	.primary:hover {
		transform: translateY(-2px);
	}

	.ghost {
		border: 1px solid rgba(245, 242, 234, 0.2);
		color: #f5f2ea;
		background: rgba(245, 242, 234, 0.05);
	}

	.hero {
		display: grid;
		grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(280px, 1fr));
		gap: clamp(28px, 6vw, 80px);
		align-items: center;
		padding: 40px 0 80px;
	}

	.hero-copy h1 {
		font-size: clamp(32px, 4vw, 56px);
		line-height: 1.05;
		margin: 16px 0;
		font-family: 'Fraunces', 'Times New Roman', serif;
	}

	.eyebrow {
		text-transform: uppercase;
		letter-spacing: 0.3em;
		font-size: 12px;
		color: #f3a35c;
	}

	.subhead {
		font-size: 18px;
		color: rgba(245, 242, 234, 0.8);
		max-width: 520px;
	}

	.hero-actions {
		display: flex;
		gap: 16px;
		margin: 24px 0;
		flex-wrap: wrap;
	}

	.trust {
		display: flex;
		align-items: center;
		gap: 16px;
		font-size: 14px;
		color: rgba(245, 242, 234, 0.75);
	}

	.pill {
		padding: 6px 12px;
		border-radius: 999px;
		background: rgba(104, 199, 209, 0.2);
		color: #68c7d1;
		font-size: 12px;
		letter-spacing: 0.08em;
		text-transform: uppercase;
	}

	.hero-card {
		background: rgba(20, 19, 30, 0.9);
		border-radius: 28px;
		border: 1px solid rgba(245, 242, 234, 0.08);
		padding: 24px;
		box-shadow: 0 30px 80px rgba(12, 11, 17, 0.6);
		backdrop-filter: blur(24px);
		animation: float 6s ease-in-out infinite;
	}

	.card-top {
		display: flex;
		justify-content: space-between;
		gap: 16px;
		margin-bottom: 20px;
	}

	.card-top h3 {
		margin: 0 0 6px;
		font-size: 18px;
	}

	.card-top p {
		margin: 0;
		font-size: 14px;
		color: rgba(245, 242, 234, 0.7);
	}

	.badge {
		border-radius: 999px;
		padding: 6px 12px;
		background: rgba(243, 163, 92, 0.2);
		color: #f3a35c;
		font-size: 12px;
		text-transform: uppercase;
		letter-spacing: 0.1em;
	}

	.card-body {
		display: grid;
		gap: 16px;
	}

	.metric {
		display: flex;
		flex-direction: column;
		gap: 4px;
		padding: 12px 16px;
		border-radius: 16px;
		background: rgba(245, 242, 234, 0.05);
	}

	.metric span {
		font-size: 12px;
		color: rgba(245, 242, 234, 0.6);
		text-transform: uppercase;
		letter-spacing: 0.14em;
	}

	.metric strong {
		font-size: 15px;
	}

	.card-footer {
		margin-top: 18px;
		display: flex;
		align-items: center;
		justify-content: space-between;
		font-size: 14px;
		color: rgba(245, 242, 234, 0.75);
	}

	.dot {
		display: inline-block;
		width: 8px;
		height: 8px;
		border-radius: 50%;
		background: #68c7d1;
		margin-right: 8px;
	}

	.grid {
		display: grid;
		grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(220px, 1fr));
		gap: 20px;
		margin-bottom: 80px;
	}

	.tile {
		background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02);
		border-radius: 20px;
		padding: 24px;
		border: 1px solid rgba(245, 242, 234, 0.1);
	}

	.tile h2,
	.tile h3 {
		margin: 0 0 12px;
	}

	.tile p {
		margin: 0;
		color: rgba(245, 242, 234, 0.7);
		font-size: 15px;
	}

	.merge-link {
		display: inline-block;
		margin-top: 18px;
		font-size: 14px;
		color: #f3a35c;
		text-decoration: none;
		transition: opacity 0.2s;
	}

	.merge-link:hover { opacity: 0.75; }

	.split {
		display: grid;
		grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(260px, 1fr));
		gap: 32px;
		margin-bottom: 80px;
	}

	.steps {
		display: grid;
		gap: 16px;
	}

	.step {
		display: flex;
		gap: 16px;
		align-items: flex-start;
		padding: 16px 18px;
		border-radius: 16px;
		background: rgba(245, 242, 234, 0.04);
		border: 1px solid rgba(245, 242, 234, 0.08);
	}

	.step span {
		width: 28px;
		height: 28px;
		border-radius: 8px;
		background: rgba(104, 199, 209, 0.2);
		display: inline-flex;
		align-items: center;
		justify-content: center;
		color: #68c7d1;
		font-weight: 600;
	}

	.step p {
		margin: 6px 0 0;
		color: rgba(245, 242, 234, 0.7);
	}

	.testimonials {
		margin-bottom: 80px;
	}

	.quote-grid {
		display: grid;
		grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(240px, 1fr));
		gap: 20px;
		margin-top: 24px;
	}

	.quote-grid article {
		padding: 22px;
		border-radius: 20px;
		background: rgba(245, 242, 234, 0.04);
		border: 1px solid rgba(245, 242, 234, 0.08);
		font-size: 15px;
		line-height: 1.5;
	}

	.quote-grid span {
		display: block;
		margin-top: 12px;
		color: rgba(245, 242, 234, 0.6);
		font-size: 13px;
	}

	.pricing {
		display: grid;
		grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(260px, 1fr));
		gap: 24px;
		margin-bottom: 80px;
	}

	.price-card {
		padding: 28px;
		border-radius: 24px;
		background: linear-gradient(140deg, rgba(243, 163, 92, 0.2), rgba(243, 96, 104, 0.1));
		border: 1px solid rgba(243, 163, 92, 0.4);
	}

	.price-card ul {
		list-style: none;
		padding: 0;
		margin: 20px 0;
		display: grid;
		gap: 10px;
		color: rgba(245, 242, 234, 0.75);
	}

	.price-card li::before {
		content: '• ';
		color: #f3a35c;
	}

	.price-details {
		padding: 28px;
		border-radius: 24px;
		background: rgba(245, 242, 234, 0.04);
		border: 1px solid rgba(245, 242, 234, 0.1);
	}

	.cta {
		padding: 36px;
		border-radius: 28px;
		background: linear-gradient(120deg, rgba(104, 199, 209, 0.2), rgba(245, 242, 234, 0.1));
		border: 1px solid rgba(104, 199, 209, 0.4);
		display: flex;
		align-items: center;
		justify-content: space-between;
		gap: 24px;
		flex-wrap: wrap;
	}

	.cta-actions {
		display: flex;
		gap: 12px;
		flex-wrap: wrap;
	}

	.chat-input {
		display: grid;
		grid-template-columns: auto 1fr auto;
		align-items: center;
		gap: 12px;
		padding: 12px 14px;
		border-radius: 999px;
		border: 1px solid rgba(245, 242, 234, 0.25);
		background: rgba(12, 11, 17, 0.6);
		box-shadow: inset 0 0 0 1px rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.04);
		min-width: min(720px, 100%);
	}

	.chat-input span {
		font-size: 12px;
		color: rgba(245, 242, 234, 0.6);
		text-transform: uppercase;
		letter-spacing: 0.2em;
		white-space: nowrap;
	}

	.chat-input input {
		background: transparent;
		border: none;
		color: inherit;
		font-size: 15px;
		outline: none;
		min-width: 160px;
	}

	.chat-input button {
		border: none;
		border-radius: 999px;
		padding: 10px 16px;
		font-size: 14px;
		background: linear-gradient(120deg, #f3a35c, #f16068);
		color: #0c0b11;
		cursor: pointer;
	}

	.chat-button {
		border-radius: 999px;
		padding: 10px 16px;
		font-size: 14px;
		background: linear-gradient(120deg, #f3a35c, #f16068);
		color: #0c0b11;
		text-decoration: none;
	}

	.footer {
		margin-top: 64px;
		display: flex;
		justify-content: space-between;
		gap: 20px;
		flex-wrap: wrap;
		color: rgba(245, 242, 234, 0.6);
		font-size: 13px;
	}

	.footer-links {
		display: flex;
		gap: 16px;
		flex-wrap: wrap;
	}

	.footer a {
		color: inherit;
		text-decoration: none;
	}

	.reveal {
		opacity: 0;
		transform: translateY(16px);
		animation: fade-up 0.8s ease forwards;
	}

	.delay-1 {
		animation-delay: 0.05s;
	}

	.delay-2 {
		animation-delay: 0.15s;
	}

	.delay-3 {
		animation-delay: 0.25s;
	}

	.delay-4 {
		animation-delay: 0.35s;
	}

	@keyframes fade-up {
		to {
			opacity: 1;
			transform: translateY(0);
		}
	}

	@keyframes float {
		0%,
		100% {
			transform: translateY(0px);
		}
		50% {
			transform: translateY(-10px);
		}
	}

	@media (max-width: 900px) {
		.nav-links {
			display: none;
		}

		.nav {
			position: static;
			padding-bottom: 12px;
		}
	}

	@media (max-width: 720px) {
		.hero-card {
			order: -1;
		}

		.trust {
			flex-direction: column;
			align-items: flex-start;
		}

		.cta {
			align-items: flex-start;
		}

		.chat-input {
			grid-template-columns: 1fr;
			border-radius: 20px;
		}

		.chat-input span {
			letter-spacing: 0.12em;
		}
	}
</style>
